🇷🇺 Key takeaways from Lavrov's address to the UN General Assembly:

▪️The West is endangering the lives of billions of people across the planet, acting recklessly and unpredictably;

▪️Europe is doing everything it can to derail the prospect of peace talks on Ukraine, which the US is also interested in;

▪️All security threats to Russia from Kiev will be eliminated as a result of the SMO;

▪️Leaders of many EU countries are infected with the virus of racial supremacy and are encouraging the spread of Nazism;

▪️The very foundations of the UN are under attack as the West shamefully turns a blind eye to the flourishing of Ukrainian Nazism;

▪️The West destroyed the European security architecture in its attempts to contain Russia;

▪️NATO is trying to extend its influence to other regions of the world, including Southeast and Northeast Asia;

▪️Peace in Europe will be restored, whatever the circumstances;

▪️Belgrade is being pressured to impose sanctions on Moscow in exchange for an illusory prospect of EU membership;

▪️Russia demands the immediate release of Maduro and his wife, and guarantees that such incidents will not be repeated;

▪️Resolving the situation around Hormuz requires restoring trust between the Arab states and Iran;

▪️Russia considers the assassination of Iran's Supreme Leader and state officials an unacceptable act of coercion by force;

▪️The UN must take unconventional steps to reverse the negative trends in West Asia;

▪️Russia is convinced that the time has come to secure Palestinian statehood;

▪️Russia calls for lifting the blockade on Cuba and urgent measures to address the dire humanitarian situation on the island;

▪️Russia expects the new UN Secretary-General not to serve the interests of individual states.

